\f0\b\fs36 \cf2 The shortest accurate version\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf2 You are trying to solve one problem through every medium available:\
How can a finite, unstable, forgetful and embodied person produce a form that remains alive, surprising and recognizably human after it leaves his control?\
Drawing answers through the hand. Music answers through waves. AI answers through interpolation. The diary answers through public memory. Teaching answers through other people. Marriage answers through shared life. The archive answers through relation. The brain answers through simulated continuation.\
The unresolved question is whether you can let those forms continue without requiring yourself to disappear into them.\
My strongest impression is that the next phase of your work is not further self-enclosure. You have already built an extraordinary container. The next phase is learning how much life, relationship and otherness it can admit without converting everything immediately into Ernest.\
}